#{\footnote Hlp_Value_Window}
${\footnote Value Window}
K{\footnote Value Window}
+{\footnote Browse:0015}

\ql\li0\fi0\ri100{\f0\fs48\cf1\up0\dn0 Value Window}{
\par}\pard
\ql\li0\fi0\ri100{\f0\fs24\cf0\up0\dn0 The Value Window is located immediately underneath the menu bar and displays text and numeric }
\ql{\f0\fs24\cf0\up0\dn0 information.  When File, Open is selected, the Value Window displays the file name, number of }
\ql{\f0\fs24\cf0\up0\dn0 observations and the number of columns in that data set.  When Data, View Dates is selected, the Value }
\ql{\f0\fs24\cf0\up0\dn0 Window displays the date-times of the current data set including any data that have been removed.   The }
\ql{\f0\fs24\cf0\up0\dn0 Value Window also displays all model parameters and inferential statistics from the modeling operations.  }
\ql{\f0\fs24\cf0\up0\dn0 This window may be cleared by clicking on the small box in the upper right hand corner of this window.}{
\par}\pard
\ql{\f0\fs24\cf0\up0\dn0
\par}\pard
